OL,3,CMake AI adoption Britain's national
OL,4,Ceconomic priority, says CBI
OL,6,FThe rollout of artificial intelligence
OL,7,F(AI) must be made a national economic
OL,8,Fpriority and firms need to move past
OL,9,F"pilot mode" to avoid being left
OL,10,Fbehind in the race to adopt the new
OL,11,Ftechnology, according to an
OL,12,Finfluential business group.
OL,14,FThe Confederation of British Industry
OL,15,F(CBI) has called on the Government to
OL,16,Fmake the next 10 years Britain's
OL,17,F"adoption decade" and put AI at the
OL,18,Fheart of its strategy for the economy
OL,19,Fand nation's workforce.
OL,26,@qD@AOUqD@LO]yD@AOUyD@QO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
