PN,30302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1787021263
OL,3,CMake AI adoption Britain's national
OL,4,Ceconomic priority, says CBI
OL,6,FIn a report published by the CBI and
OL,7,FOliver Wyman, they warn that there is
OL,8,Fa growing "execution divide" for
OL,9,Fcompanies who are scaling up the use
OL,10,Fof AI throughout their organisation
OL,11,Fand those left in so-called pilot mode.
OL,13,FAlmost half (49%) of firms who are
OL,14,Fleading the way in using AI report
OL,15,Fthat they are meeting or surpassing
OL,16,Ftheir expected return on investment,
OL,17,Fcompared with just 15% of those which
OL,18,Fare behind in rolling out AI,
OL,19,Faccording to research by Oliver Wyman
OL,20,FForum and the New York Stock Exchange.
OL,26,@pD@KOUpD@\O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
