OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1787021263
OL,3,CMake AI adoption Britain's national
OL,4,Ceconomic priority, says CBI
OL,6,FRain Newton-Smith, CBI chief
OL,7,Fexecutive, said:"The next chapter of
OL,8,FAI won't just be defined by what we
OL,9,Finvent, but by how quickly we can put
OL,10,Fit to work at scale.
OL,12,F"Britain now needs to treat AI
OL,13,Fadoption as a national economic
OL,14,Fpriority.
OL,16,F"Government and business should set a
OL,17,Fshared ambition to make the UK the
OL,18,Fbest place in the world to adopt AI
OL,19,Fresponsibly, and then relentlessly
OL,20,Ffocus on delivery.
OL,26,@oD@ROUtD@AOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1787021263
OL,3,CMake AI adoption Britain's national
OL,4,Ceconomic priority, says CBI
OL,6,F"That means moving beyond pilots and
OL,7,Fputting AI to work across our economy,
OL,8,Fgiving businesses the confidence to
OL,9,Finvest and workers the skills and
OL,10,Fsecurity to embrace change."
OL,12,FThe plea is for the Government to work
OL,13,Fwith business, workers and civil
OL,14,Fsociety to "accelerate adoption of AI,
OL,15,Fbuild public confidence and ensure it
OL,16,Fdelivers better jobs, higher living
OL,17,Fstandards and stronger growth in every
OL,18,Fpart of the country".
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@\O]vD@LOUzD@TO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1787021263
OL,3,CMake AI adoption Britain's national
OL,4,Ceconomic priority, says CBI
OL,6,FThe CBI wants the Government to set up
OL,7,Fa business AI adoption delivery group,
OL,8,Flay out a voluntary responsible AI
OL,9,Fadoption code and public pledge,
OL,10,Finvest in AI skills at all levels and
OL,11,Fdevelop a national AI literacy
OL,12,Fstandard, and have easy-to-navigate
OL,13,Fregulation surrounding the technology.
OL,15,F"If we get this right, the prize won't
OL,16,Fbe measured in technology alone ` it
OL,17,Fwill be measured in better jobs,
OL,18,Frising wages, stronger businesses and
OL,19,Fhigher living standards," Ms Newton-
OL,20,FSmith said.
OL,26,@wD@AOU{D@YO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
