OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1787021263
OL,3,CMake AI adoption Britain's national
OL,4,Ceconomic priority, says CBI
OL,6,FIt comes after Prime Minister Andy
OL,7,FBurnham appointed Kanishka Narayan as
OL,8,Fthe UK's first AI minister.
OL,10,FMr Narayan said the CBI's report is a
OL,11,F"welcome contribution" to the debate
OL,12,Fon how to realise AI's full potential.
OL,14,FHe added: "We are committed to making
OL,15,Fthe UK the leading adopter of AI in
OL,16,Fthe G7.
OL,26,@sD@AOUsD@VO]vD@KOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1787021263
OL,3,CMake AI adoption Britain's national
OL,4,Ceconomic priority, says CBI
OL,6,F"That is why we are working with
OL,7,Findustry to give 10 million workers AI
OL,8,Fskills by 2030 and investing more than
OL,9,F#200 million to support workers and
OL,10,Fbusinesses in adopting the technology."
OL,12,FProfessor Simon Johnson, chair of the
OL,13,FUK's AI Economics Institute, said the
OL,14,Frise of AI was going to lead to an
OL,15,F"intense" industrial transformation,
OL,16,Fbut the UK "has some time" to adapt.
OL,18,FHe told BBC's Newsnight: "This
OL,19,Ftechnology is arriving and it's
OL,20,Farriving fast. But I think the
OL,21,Fcompanies are exaggerating.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@gO]wD@AOUwD@IO]xD@LOUxD@ZO]zD@
OL,26,AZOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
