OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1787021263
OL,3,CMake AI adoption Britain's national
OL,4,Ceconomic priority, says CBI
OL,6,F"They are obviously trying to attract
OL,7,Fand impress investors. The technology
OL,8,Fis impressive, but we do have some
OL,9,Ftime.
OL,11,F"We have time if we act now to prepare
OL,12,Fand to build a stronger, more
OL,13,Fresilient economy with more good jobs,
OL,14,Fthat incorporates AI and that's
OL,15,Fempowered by AI, the key thing is to
OL,16,Favoid getting run over by AI."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUxD@^O]
