PN,30309
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1787021263
OL,3,CMake AI adoption Britain's national
OL,4,Ceconomic priority, says CBI
OL,6,FThe report comes as separate research
OL,7,Fby Lloyds Banking Group found more
OL,8,Fthan half (58%) of firms say they
OL,9,Fbelieve AI has created jobs within
OL,10,Ftheir organisations, but that almost a
OL,11,Fthird (31%) say their workforce does
OL,12,Fnot yet have the skills needed.
OL,14,FThe survey of 1,200 UK businesses
OL,15,Fshowed 61% of firms say they currently
OL,16,Fuse AI, with just under half (46%) of
OL,17,Fdomestically-focused businesses more
OL,18,Flikely to use the technology, compared
OL,19,Fwith 63% of firms operating overseas.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/9
